dummynet with the CAKE scheduler built in and packets released between
clock ticks (net.inet.ip.dummynet.release_us), as dummynet_st.ko. os-cake
loads it instead of the stock dummynet.ko, unless switched off on its
page; nothing loads it at boot.

The module is built for one FreeBSD release and replaces one stock
dummynet.ko, whose SHA256 it records. os-cake does not load it on another
release or with another dummynet.ko, and uses the stock dummynet and
dn_cake.ko instead.
